<title>BELGIUM: Solvay opens Internet site.</title>
<headline>Solvay opens Internet site.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian chemical group Solvay said on Wednesday it had opened a world wide web site on the Internet.</p>
<p>The site (http://www.solvay.com) provides information about the company's history, activities, products and financial results.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
